## citation spot checks (curl)
## template-press-cli
url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/smorinlabs/template-press/v4.0.1/docs/source/reference/cli.md
http: 200
sha256: 64bc981ce433fce7af2c59093a7988905a8ca385107e95c010fb39ea292bbb04
7:## `press rebrand`
12:press rebrand --target <path> --config <press-answers.toml> [options]
15:In a development checkout, run it through uv: `uv run press rebrand …`
26:| `--dry-run` | Print the plan and exit without touching the target. |
27:| `--force` | Override a safety guard. It permits re-pressing a target that already has a receipt and, when atomic no-replacement rename is unavailable, permits a warned non-atomic fallback. The fallback checks the destination immediately before each move, but a destination created in the remaining race window may be overwritten. |
32:The exit code is the contract — scripts and CI can branch on it:
36:| `0` | Verified: the rebrand completed and no source identity remains; a receipt was written. |
37:| `1` | Leaks found after applying — a partial/incorrect rebrand. **No receipt** is written; the target is left rewritten (restore with `git -C <target> checkout . && git clean -fd`). |

